# Unit02
# 领域: 考研
# 学科: 英语词汇
# 来源: 2024红宝书考研英语词汇
# 描述: 基础词Unit02核心词汇

adventure/ədˈventʃər/冒险；奇遇/He told us about his adventures in Africa.
advertise/ˈædvərtaɪz/做广告；宣传/The company advertises its products on TV.
advice/ədˈvaɪs/建议；忠告/She gave me some useful advice on studying.
advocate/ˈædvəkeɪt/提倡；拥护/He advocates for environmental protection.
affair/əˈfer/事务；事件/The government handles foreign affairs.
affect/əˈfekt/影响；感动/The bad weather affected the harvest.
afford/əˈfɔːrd/买得起；承担得起/I can't afford to buy a new car.
afraid/əˈfreɪd/害怕的；恐惧的/She is afraid of the dark.
against/əˈɡenst/反对；对着/He voted against the proposal.
age/eɪdʒ/年龄；时代/Children of all age groups are welcome.
agency/ˈeɪdʒənsi/代理机构/He works for a travel agency.
agenda/əˈdʒendə/议程；日程/The agenda for the meeting is very long.
agent/ˈeɪdʒənt/代理人；特工/He is an agent for a famous company.
aggressive/əˈɡresɪv/侵略性的；有进取心的/He has an aggressive personality.
ago/əˈɡoʊ/以前/I met her two years ago.
agree/əˈɡriː/同意；赞同/I agree with your opinion.
agriculture/ˈæɡrɪkʌltʃər/农业/Agriculture is the backbone of the economy.
ahead/əˈhed/在前面；提前/The road ahead is very wide.
aim/eɪm/目标；瞄准/His aim is to become a scientist.
air/er/空气；航空/Fresh air is important for health.
alarm/əˈlɑːrm/警报；惊慌/The fire alarm went off at midnight.
album/ˈælbəm/相册；专辑/She released a new album last month.
alcohol/ˈælkəhɔːl/酒精；酒/Drinking too much alcohol is harmful to health.
alert/əˈlɜːrt/警觉的；提醒/Be alert to any changes in the situation.
alien/ˈeɪliən/外星人；陌生的/The concept is alien to most people.
alike/əˈlaɪk/相似的；一样地/The two sisters look very alike.
alive/əˈlaɪv/活着的；有活力的/He is still alive and well.
allow/əˈlaʊ/允许；准许/Smoking is not allowed in this building.
ally/ˈælaɪ/同盟国；盟友/The two countries became close allies.
almost/ˈɔːlmoʊst/几乎；差不多/The work is almost finished.
alone/əˈloʊn/独自的；单独的/She lives alone in a big house.
along/əˈlɔːŋ/沿着；一起/Walk along the street and turn left.
alphabet/ˈælfəbet/字母表/He learned the English alphabet at age three.
already/ɔːlˈredi/已经/She has already finished her homework.
alter/ˈɔːltər/改变；修改/We need to alter the plan slightly.
alternative/ɔːlˈtɜːrnətɪv/可选择的；替代的/We need to find an alternative solution.
although/ɔːlˈðoʊ/虽然；尽管/Although it rained, we still went out.
altogether/ˌɔːltəˈɡeðər/总共；完全/The cost is altogether 500 dollars.
aluminum/ˌæljuˈmɪniəm/铝/Aluminum is a lightweight metal.
always/ˈɔːlweɪz/总是；一直/She always arrives on time.
amaze/əˈmeɪz/使惊奇；使惊叹/The magician's tricks amazed the audience.
ambition/æmˈbɪʃn/野心；抱负/Her ambition is to become a great writer.
ambitious/æmˈbɪʃəs/有雄心的；有抱负的/He is an ambitious young man.
amend/əˈmend/修正；改进/We need to amend the regulations.
among/əˈmʌŋ/在…之中/She is the tallest among all the students.
amount/əˈmaʊnt/数量；总额/A large amount of money was spent on the project.
amuse/əˈmjuːz/使发笑；使愉快/The clown amused the children.
analyze/ˈænəlaɪz/分析；解析/We need to analyze the data carefully.
ancestor/ˈænsestər/祖先；祖宗/Our ancestors lived in this area thousands of years ago.
ancient/ˈeɪnʃənt/古代的；古老的/Ancient civilizations left many ruins.
